      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Randomized single-blind case--control study is performed. In total, the cadet corp students with recurrent functional abdominal pain and headaches are examined. The paper shows the role of various risk factors in the occurrence of these states. Diagnostic validity is evaluated. Multifactorial genesis of the studied pathology is proved. The essential role in the formation of the psychological characteristics of personality, neurotic states and autonomic dysfunction is shown. Several constitutional characteristics of the organism were not diagnostically significant."},
